    "html": "<p>Two identical satellites, A and B, orbit a planet. The distance of satellite A from the surface of the planet is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"x\"></span> and the distance of satellite B from the surface of the planet is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2x\"></span>. What is true about the kinetic energy and the total energy of satellite B compared with satellite A?</p>\n\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Kinetic energy of B</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Total energy of B</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"A\">\n<td><strong>A.</strong></td>\n<td>Higher</td>\n<td>Higher</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"B\">\n<td><strong>B.</strong></td>\n<td>Lower</td>\n<td>Lower</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"C\">\n<td><strong>C.</strong></td>\n<td>Lower</td>\n<td>Higher</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"D\">\n<td><strong>D.</strong></td>\n<td>Higher</td>\n<td>Lower</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
